                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndakaumwa misako kotatwe, ndakafuswa mabwe lomwe, ndakafwidwa bwaato kotatwe, ciindi cimwi ndakali mukati kalwizi buzuba boonse isikati amasiku. ",
          "type": "text",
