                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela antoomwe azintu zimwi zyoonse nkucili cimwi cindilemena mazuba oonse, ndijisi milimo yakubambila imbungano zyoonse. ",
          "type": "text",
